                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.24/299: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1940-12-18T12:00:00+01:00">December 18,
                        1940—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received December 18—7:15 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>4110. For the Under Secretary. My 4106, Dec. 17, 8 p.m. Foreign Office informs me
                    that orders were issued this morning for the release of the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Siqueira Campos.</hi></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
